  "review": "Integer ceiling and inclusive deadlines match recurrence. Release jitter and dispatch are charged to each interfering job, task blocking is charged once. Supplied independent synchronous tick simulator checks eight feasible configurations over two hyperperiods by comparing observed response <= bound.",
  "limitations": "Host evidence only. Simulation covers zero jitter, blocking, dispatch and IRQs. Safety depends on externally justified execution and interference budgets. Public document gives the iteration default but omits the JSON option name iteration_limit."
